                <li><b>Facilities: </b> Ticket counters, waiting areas, restrooms, small cafés, baggage services, paid parking, and accessible facilities.</li>
                <li><b>Architecture: </b> The historic station features classic railroad architecture in a charming Old Town setting worth arriving early to appreciate.</li>
                <li><b>Signage: </b>   Platforms and departure boards are clearly marked for easy navigation.</li>
                <li><b>Transit Access: </b> Easily reachable via Metro (Blue and Yellow Lines), DASH buses, VRE commuter rail, and rideshare services. Old Town's shops and restaurants are within walking distance.</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>Boarding Process</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Platforms are usually announced 10-15 minutes before departure.</li>
                <li>Boarding is straightforward, with clearly marked coach and business class cars.</li>
                <li>No airport-style security checks, making the process quick and simple.</li>
